Description: graphical ManageSieve filter editor for Evolution
 Edit existing Sieve filters from an integrated Evolution preferences page.
 The extension uses an IMAP account's connection details and supports
 Dovecot/Pigeonhole ManageSieve servers over STARTTLS.
